    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "9e8d86d7_74e3e311",
        "filename": "core/cortex-m/build.mk",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 33,
      "author": {
        "id": 1314845
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-06-14T00:08:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I will add a comment, but it\u0027s from the \"interesting\" macro in that file. I could make it for clang only.\n\nSnippet of first warning (repeated):\n\n\tIn file included from core/cortex-m/vecttable.c:385:\n\tcore/cortex-m/vecttable.c:275:2: error: initializer overrides prior initialization of this subobject [-Werror,-Winitializer-overrides]\n\t\tirq(150)\n\t\t^~~~~~~~\n\tcore/cortex-m/vecttable.c:102:84: note: expanded from macro \u0027irq\u0027\n\t#define irq(num) [num \u003c CONFIG_IRQ_COUNT ? num + IRQ_OFFSET : IRQ_UNUSED_OFFSET] \u003d vec(irq_ ## num)\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   ^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\tcore/cortex-m/vecttable.c:101:19: note: expanded from macro \u0027vec\u0027\n\t#define vec(name) name ## _handler,\n\t\t\t  ^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\t\u003cscratch space\u003e:207:1: note: expanded from here\n\tirq_150_handler\n\t^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\tcore/cortex-m/vecttable.c:97:3: note: expanded from macro \u0027table\u0027\n\t\t\tx                                                               \\\n\t\t\t^\n\tcore/cortex-m/vecttable.c:117:2: note: previous initialization is here\n\t\tnull\n\t\t^~~~\n\tcore/cortex-m/vecttable.c:105:14: note: expanded from macro \u0027null\u0027\n\t#define null (void*)0,\n\t\t     ^~~~~~~~\n\tcore/cortex-m/vecttable.c:97:3: note: expanded from macro \u0027table\u0027\n\t\t\tx                                                               \\\n\t\t\t^\n\tcore/cortex-m/vecttable.c:276:2: error: initializer overrides prior initialization of this subobject [-Werror,-Winitializer-overrides]\n\t\tirq(151)\n\t\t^~~~~~~~",
      "parentUuid": "73264729_2267fc58",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 29,
